      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. so if it's an asset that needs to be depreciated, does that mean i can't just write the whole thing off this year? and how do i handle the part where i use the same workspace for some of my personal drawing too? like, does the whole thing have to be 100% business or is there a way to split it?",
